# End of S4 RED log.

(Recording note, added while finishing the slice: the a21 spec third test originally navigated to `?testForceUnsupported=1`, a flag the app never had — it failed on #model-banner for THAT reason in both the first RED pass and the RED top-up. The correct test-only override is `?testProbe=unsupported` (S3 parseTestFlags); the spec was fixed to use it during the GREEN integration smoke. On the pre-feature app the FIXED spec still fails RED at the missing `#llm-status` element, so this test RED verdict is unchanged. The other S4 RED failures are the genuine missing-UI verdicts shown above.)
